WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.557
The machine is running. Open console shows its screen right in the browser.

00:00:06.657 --> 00:00:17.916
It is a real screen and keyboard: log in with the user chosen at the start.

00:00:18.016 --> 00:00:28.108
Keyboard sends the combinations the browser would keep for itself: Ctrl+Alt+Del, function keys, the other terminals.

00:00:28.208 --> 00:00:41.473
SSH opens a real terminal next to the screen, with the project's own key: no password.

00:00:41.573 --> 00:00:49.630
Files browses the machine's folders: drop files to upload them, click to download.

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:58.378
Screenshot, recording, and the console in its own window are one click away.

00:00:58.478 --> 00:01:05.166
Next: a lab with two machines on their own network.
